        {
          "unit_index": 57,
          "verse": 16,
          "content_chars": 18,
          "text": "16 他来过些到 __VILLAGE_A__ ，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 58,
          "verse": 16,
          "content_chars": 10,
          "text": "那里了是地方他长大的。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 59,
          "verse": 16,
          "content_chars": 5,
          "text": "日到过安息，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 77,
          "verse": 20,
          "content_chars": 16,
          "text": "的众人都会些堂里目不转睛地看着他。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 81,
          "verse": 22,
          "content_chars": 7,
          "text": "22 赞他着众人都称，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 96,
          "verse": 24,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "往群往不得尊着敬。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 102,
          "verse": 26,
          "content_chars": 26,
          "text": "26 但 __PROPHET_A__ 并没有被那里了去差到他们，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 109,
          "verse": 28,
