          "text": "28 话着听见这些，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 135,
          "verse": 35,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "从了他身上出来个！"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 150,
          "verse": 38,
          "content_chars": 20,
          "text": "他们请 __PERSON_F__ 帮助名她过。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 158,
          "verse": 41,
          "content_chars": 7,
          "text": "41 鬼附过许多人被，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 167,
          "verse": 42,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "他人们着寻找，"
